WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.743 --> 00:00:16.184
Bobby entered the kitchen and smiled at his friends.

2
00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:19.486
"Cooking class will be great today!"

3
00:00:19.506 --> 00:00:22.107
"Why?" Izzie asked.

4
00:00:22.127 --> 00:00:26.290
"Bobby, should we tell the others about your guest?"

5
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:27.971
Chef smiled.

6
00:00:27.991 --> 00:00:31.312
"Not yet," Bobby said.

7
00:00:31.332 --> 00:00:33.614
"Let's surprise them."

8
00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.174
"Sounds good."

9
00:00:36.175 --> 00:00:38.576
Chef nodded and pointed to the recipe screen.

10
00:00:38.596 --> 00:00:42.018
"We're making oatmeal raisin cookies today.

11
00:00:42.818 --> 00:00:45.179
They'll be dessert for the sack lunches we'll pack.

12
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.701
Bobby will tell you more about the lunches later."

13
00:00:48.721 --> 00:00:51.442
"Why the big secret?"

14
00:00:51.902 --> 00:00:52.723
Jason asked.

15
00:00:54.243 --> 00:00:55.284
Bobby just grinned.

16
00:00:57.792 --> 00:01:01.275
Chef heated the oven to 175 degrees Celsius.

17
00:01:01.295 --> 00:01:04.338
"Let's mix the dry ingredients."

18
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.562
Bobby measured the flour and poured it into a bowl.

19
00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.465
Nina added one teaspoon of baking soda.

20
00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:16.189
Izzie put in one teaspoon of cinnamon.

21
00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.212
Jason poured in a half teaspoon of salt.

22
00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:23.816
Bobby mixed the ingredients together.

23
00:01:24.956 --> 00:01:28.217
Next, Izzie measured three-quarters of a cup of brown sugar.

24
00:01:29.757 --> 00:01:31.498
She got a spoon and packed it down.

25
00:01:31.518 --> 00:01:35.259
"Pack it firmly," Bobby said.

26
00:01:36.319 --> 00:01:37.399
Izzie rolled her eyes.

27
00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:39.340
"I am!"

28
00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.421
She dumped the brown sugar into another mixing bowl.

29
00:01:45.042 --> 00:01:47.102
Nina poured in half a cup of white sugar.

30
00:01:48.723 --> 00:01:51.023
Jason added 14 tablespoons of butter.

31
00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:54.908
"That's a lot of butter," Bobby said.

32
00:01:54.928 --> 00:01:57.370
"But I can do the mixing!

33
00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:00.131
I know how to get out all the lumps."

34
00:02:01.312 --> 00:02:04.273
He mixed the butter and sugars until the mixture looked creamy.

35
00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:06.835
Izzie added vanilla.

36
00:02:09.296 --> 00:02:10.477
Nina cracked two eggs.

37
00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:15.619
"Don't get any shells in there," Bobby snapped.

38
00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:18.181
"I won't!"

39
00:02:18.621 --> 00:02:19.321
Nina said.

40
00:02:19.341 --> 00:02:23.804
"Bobby! Stop being so bossy," Jason said.

41
00:02:24.828 --> 00:02:27.089
"I want these cookies to be perfect."

42
00:02:28.649 --> 00:02:30.470
Bobby mixed the ingredients again.

43
00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:34.791
"Now add the dry ingredients," Chef said.

44
00:02:34.811 --> 00:02:37.252
"I'll do it!"

45
00:02:37.492 --> 00:02:38.252
Bobby said.

46
00:02:38.272 --> 00:02:42.573
"It's Izzie's turn to use the mixer," Chef said.

47
00:02:44.254 --> 00:02:46.254
Bobby frowned, but he stepped aside.

48
00:02:47.394 --> 00:02:50.055
Izzie added the dry ingredients to the butter mixture.

49
00:02:51.376 --> 00:02:52.676
Then she started mixing.

50
00:02:55.476 --> 00:02:58.697
Jason poured in three cups of oats while Nina added raisins.

51
00:03:01.039 --> 00:03:02.259
Izzie mixed the dough again.

52
00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:07.721
Everyone took turns dropping spoonfuls of dough onto a baking sheet.

53
00:03:07.741 --> 00:03:13.644
"Nina, yours are too close together," Bobby said.

54
00:03:13.664 --> 00:03:16.565
"And Jason's are too small."

55
00:03:18.326 --> 00:03:19.146
Chef sighed.

56
00:03:21.027 --> 00:03:22.408
"They're doing fine, Bobby."

57
00:03:25.844 --> 00:03:27.245
Nina put the sheet in the oven.

58
00:03:28.907 --> 00:03:30.768
Chef set the timer for eight minutes.

59
00:03:30.788 --> 00:03:34.532
"Time to make the sandwiches," he said.

60
00:03:36.153 --> 00:03:38.155
The kids made tuna salad sandwiches.

61
00:03:39.296 --> 00:03:40.757
They put each one in a sack.

62
00:03:41.818 --> 00:03:43.659
They added carrot sticks and an apple.

63
00:03:45.241 --> 00:03:46.241
The timer went off.

64
00:03:49.144 --> 00:03:51.206
"Let's check the cookies," Chef said.

65
00:03:51.226 --> 00:03:53.668
"They should be golden brown."

66
00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.621
The cookies looked perfect.

67
00:04:00.302 --> 00:04:02.363
After they had cooled, everyone ate one.

68
00:04:02.383 --> 00:04:04.624
"They're great!"

69
00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:05.984
Bobby said, grinning.

70
00:04:07.685 --> 00:04:09.426
The kids put a cookie in each sack.

71
00:04:09.446 --> 00:04:12.807
"Hi, kids!"

72
00:04:13.227 --> 00:04:13.968
someone said.

73
00:04:13.988 --> 00:04:17.889
"Grandpa!" Bobby shouted.

74
00:04:17.909 --> 00:04:20.250
"The lunches are ready."

75
00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:24.692
"Thank you for making these," Grandpa said.

76
00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:29.861
"The lunches are for older people in our neighborhood," Bobby said.

77
00:04:29.881 --> 00:04:35.503
"Grandpa says they sometimes have trouble getting out to shop for food.

78
00:04:36.503 --> 00:04:39.544
Some don't have much money, so they might skip meals.

79
00:04:41.284 --> 00:04:43.105
I asked Chef if we could help them."

80
00:04:43.125 --> 00:04:45.965
"Great idea!"

81
00:04:46.866 --> 00:04:48.366
Nina smiled at Grandpa.

82
00:04:49.226 --> 00:04:50.507
Izzie and Jason nodded.

83
00:04:50.527 --> 00:04:55.528
"Now Grandpa and I will deliver these," Bobby said.

84
00:04:56.405 --> 00:04:57.875
"Thanks for helping!"
